math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KnasterPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KnasterPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\\in V\">\\(\\omega_1\\in V\\)</span> (first uncountable ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}knaster\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KnasterPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(|A|=\\omega_1\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(|B|=\\omega_1\\land\\forall p,q\\in B\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}knaster\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KnasterPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(|A|=\\omega_1\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(|B|=\\omega_1\\land\\forall p,q\\in B\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order is an explicit argument, and compatibility is expanded as the existence of a common stronger condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega_1\\in V$ (first uncountable ordinal, see [[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KnasterPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}knaster\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10KnasterPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(|A|=\\omega_1\\to\\exists B\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(|B|=\\omega_1\\land\\forall p,q\\in B\\;(p\\neq q\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1352,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2004","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing10-knaster-poset.md|58-df-zfc-forcing10-knaster-poset]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","27ae6ad867a7007d","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}